        "Title": "ICA Saboteurs",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ICA_FACILITY",
        "PublicId": "101458300690",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/thefacility/_scene_polarbear_005.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository d5f37ab6-1053-4864-b691-17078d8917d1).Image",
        "Description": "ICA-Saboteurs have infiltrated an airport in Cuba and plan to stop Jasper Knight, a soviet spy, who has gathered crucial information for the KGB, from escaping to safety. Your job as an KGB agent is to eliminate them without attracting too much attention, since the local personnel is uninformed about the situation and on high alert.\rStop them before they can sabotage Knight&apos;s escape aircraft.\rGood Luck.",
